--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d22778bf57e3fca41942264a944f8db6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chapter One Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSequence
  lines:
  - text: Hey. Still not answering my calls, huh?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Don''t blame you. I wouldn''t either. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Listen. I have my regrets. We both do. Your Mother and I. We were lost
      for a long time. Kept telling ourselves we were doing our best. Guess that's
      where we were wrong.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "We should\u2019ve been there for you, especially for the times when you
      needed us most. We know that now. "
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Your mother talks about you all the time. She keeps asking if you\u2019re
      ever coming home. I\u2019ll tell her I don\u2019t know"
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Anyway, if you do decide to come back. The hotel is yours now. Keys are
      in the security box by the front doors. Code is 4673. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Upper floors are blocked off.  Elevator was shut down back in February.
      We couldn't afford the repairs once the medical bills started to hit.  Can't
      afford much of anything right now.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Lights still work. Most of the time. And some rooms might need a bit of
      sprucing up. But I'm sure that's not too much for you to handle
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026would be nice seeing this place alive again."
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - text: 'Hope to hear from you. Love you. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
